00:00:29.909 --> 00:00:31.917
You know the game's not
called "Operation Friends."

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:33.902
- When you're doing surgery
you need to be confident,

00:00:33.902 --> 00:00:36.783
you need to go for it,
and if you bump something

00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:39.206
