00:00:40.663 --> 00:00:43.007
I am going to destroy everybody else.

00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:44.389
Do you guys know how to
play this game actually?

00:00:44.389 --> 00:00:46.438
- No.

00:00:46.438 --> 00:00:48.638
- One thing you don't want to
do in surgery is just wing it.

00:01:03.356 --> 00:01:04.272
- Apparently this is Sam.

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:05.704
- [Courtney] Okay, hi Sam.
Hello.

00:01:05.704 --> 00:01:07.879
Repair Sam's heart and charge your fee.

00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:10.273
He'll thank you most wholeheartedly.

00:01:10.743 --> 00:01:13.217
I just made that
infinitely more difficult.

00:01:13.217 --> 00:01:13.759
- Exactly.

00:01:13.759 --> 00:01:14.730
- You have to have a steady hand.

00:01:16.012 --> 00:01:17.818
- [Courtney] Butterflies in stomach.

00:01:17.818 --> 00:01:20.163
- I think this game is
actually impossible. Or not.

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.715
- Alright.

00:01:21.715 --> 00:01:23.443
- Well done.

00:01:23.443 --> 00:01:24.989
Student loans.

00:01:24.989 --> 00:01:25.873
- Yes, student loans.

00:01:25.873 --> 00:01:28.643
- This goes to salary,
mate. Thank you very much.

00:01:28.643 --> 00:01:30.275
- So now we've got the wishbone.

00:01:30.275 --> 00:01:31.696
- [Alissa] So when we played this as a kid

00:01:31.696 --> 00:01:33.371
this is how I learned anatomy.

00:01:33.371 --> 00:01:36.509
- So the wishbone's
connected to the thighbone.

00:01:36.949 --> 00:01:38.961
Amazing. Nice job.

00:01:38.961 --> 00:01:41.195
- Can I get knuckles on it?

00:01:41.195 --> 00:01:42.529
- [Alissa] Water on the knee.

00:01:45.699 --> 00:01:47.203
- She's on the board.
[crosstalk]

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:50.115
- I want to thank my fellow surgeons.

00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:52.100
