00:02:26.162 --> 00:02:27.902
- Six hundred dollars, please.

00:02:27.902 --> 00:02:28.752
- Wow.

00:02:28.752 --> 00:02:30.429
- [Wenjay] Stretch your
leg from peg to peg

00:02:30.429 --> 00:02:32.687
