00:02:32.687 --> 00:02:34.683
This is actually really hard.

00:02:34.703 --> 00:02:35.343
(buzzer)

00:02:35.343 --> 00:02:36.811
- Oh.

00:02:36.811 --> 00:02:39.724
- I've been working up
toward this my entire life.

00:02:39.724 --> 00:02:40.669
(buzzer)

00:02:40.669 --> 00:02:42.022
That was intense.

00:02:42.022 --> 00:02:43.783
- It screamed at you this time.

00:02:46.213 --> 00:02:47.302
(buzzer)
- [Wenjay] Oh.

00:02:48.546 --> 00:02:50.682
